{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q208942","formula":"C₆H₇N","hill":"C6H7N","elements":["H","C","N"],"composition":{"C":6.0,"H":7.0,"N":1.0},"names":{"en":"Azepine","ru":"Азепин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Azepine is an unsaturated heterocycle of seven atoms, with a nitrogen replacing a carbon at one position. The atoms are numbered starting with the nitrogen. The 1H-azepine isomer shown above is an unstable red oil at -78°C and rearranges on contact with acid or base to 3H-azepine with two hydrogen atoms attached to the third carbon.","ru":"Азепин (азациклогептатриен) — гетероциклическое азотосодержащее ненасыщенное органическое соединение. Теоретически возможны 4 изомера: 1H-, 2H-, 3H-, и 4H-азепин, однако ни один из них не выделен. Среди производных азепинов устойчивость уменьшается в ряду: 3H-азепин > 1H-азепин > 4H-азепин > 2H-азепин."},"fame":22,"pubchemCid":6451476,"mass":93.13,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1=CC=CNC=C1","inchikey":"XYOVOXDWRFGKEX-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"1H-azepine","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"6451476","atoms":14,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":0.0,"y":-1.573,"z":0.0,"el":"N"},{"x":1.232,"y":-0.978,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.232,"y":-0.979,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":1.571,"y":0.317,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.571,"y":0.317,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.671,"y":1.448,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.671,"y":1.448,"z":0.0,"el":"C"},{"x":0.0,"y":-2.588,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":2.021,"y":-1.726,"z":0.0,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.02,"y":-1.726,"z":0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":2.629,"y":0.571,"z":0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":-2.629,"y":0.571,"z":0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":1.172,"y":2.415,"z":-0.001,"el":"H"},{"x":-1.173,"y":2.414,"z":-0.001,"el":"H"}],"bonds":[[0,1,1],[0,2,1],[0,7,1],[1,3,2],[1,8,1],[2,4,2],[2,9,1],[3,5,1],[3,10,1],[4,6,1],[4,11,1],[5,6,2],[5,12,1],[6,13,1]]},"sources":[{"role":"i